<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FTL>
<mod:findName type="event" name="STORAGE_CHECK_BUTTON">
  <mod-append:choice req="OE_ACID_O2SYS" blue="true" hidden="true">
    <text>Acidic Filtering System.</text>
    <event load="STORAGE_CHECK_OE_O2SYS" />
  </mod-append:choice>
  <mod-append:choice req="OE_ACID_O2SYS_OFF" blue="true" hidden="true">
    <text>Acidic Filtering System.</text>
    <event load="STORAGE_CHECK_OE_O2SYS_OFF" />
  </mod-append:choice>
</mod:findName>

<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_OE_O2SYS">
	<text>What do you want to do?</text>
	<checkCargo />
	<choice>
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK" />
	</choice>

  <choice hidden="true">
    <text>Set Filtering System to Extinguisher Mode (Currently Enabled).</text>
    <event load="OPTION_INVALID"/>
  </choice>

  <choice>
    <text>Set Filtering System to Oxygen Mode.</text>
    <event>
      <text>Your Filtering system shifts over to begin producing oxygen.</text>
      <remove name="OE_ACID_O2SYS"/>
      <choice>
        <text>Continue...</text>
        <event>
          <text>The system's lifesupport subsystem slows down.</text>
          <augment name="OE_ACID_O2SYS_OFF"/>
          <choice>
            <text>Continue...</text>
            <event load="STORAGE_CHECK" />
          </choice>
        </event>
      </choice>
    </event>
  </choice>
</event>


<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_OE_O2SYS_OFF">
  <text>What do you want to do?</text>
  <checkCargo />
	<choice>
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK" />
	</choice>

  <choice>
    <text>Set Filtering System to Extinguisher Mode.</text>
    <event>
      <text>Your Filtering system shifts over to begin producing fire suppressant.</text>
      <remove name="OE_ACID_O2SYS_OFF"/>
      <choice>
        <text>Continue...</text>
        <event>
          <text>The system's lifesupport subsystem becomes more efficient.</text>
          <augment name="OE_ACID_O2SYS"/>
          <choice>
            <text>Continue...</text>
            <event load="STORAGE_CHECK" />
          </choice>
        </event>
      </choice>
    </event>
  </choice>

  <choice hidden="true">
    <text>Set Filtering System to Oxygen Mode (Currently Enabled).</text>
    <event load="OPTION_INVALID"/>
  </choice>
</event>

<mod:findName name="STORAGE_CHECK_AUG_OE_BOSS_SPAWNER_LIST" type="event">
  <mod-append:choice hidden="true">
		<text>Acidic Destroyer B - Drops Acid Splasher</text>
		<event>
			<text>You power up the machine to max and watch as a rift opens, shaking the ship until suddenly it powers off, and a flashing green light followed by a string of coordinates signifies that it has worked.</text>
			<item_modify>
				<item type="fuel" min="-7" max="-7" />
			</item_modify>
			<quest event="MV_TRAVELER_OET_BOSS_ACID_CHALLENGE" />
		</event>
	</mod-append:choice>
</mod:findName>

<mod:findName name="STORAGE_CHECK_STATUS_LOOT">
	<mod-append:choice hidden="true" req="ach_trans_oe_acid" lvl="1" blue="false">
		<text>(Acidic Origins)</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID"/>
	</mod-append:choice>
</mod:findName>

<mod:findName name="STORAGE_CHECK_STATUS_MV">
	<mod-append:choice hidden="true" req="ach_ren_oe_acid" lvl="1" blue="false">
		<text>Acidic Destroyer</text>
		<event>
			<text>CLASS: Acidic Destroyer
			FACTION: Acidic Growth
			
			Acidic Growth, in its expansion campaign, quickly learnt that the universe is a dangerous place. While they had support from the Gathering in finances and resources, they did not provide combat-ready ships, insisting on keeping guard on their own. Obviously, this did not help with spreading Growth's territories. So, the Growth started to make more than just civilian ships, quickly becoming famous for its advanced weaponry. But, as the armaments improved, its ship-building couldn't quite keep up... That is, until the Gathering shared some of their engineers due to the rising threat of the Rebellion and Coalition. After the creation of Acidic Cruiser, the next project required enough power to wield as big of an arsenal as possible. Named Acidic Destroyer, the new ship came installed with up to 6 weapon slots, achieving the biggest firepower it could without artillery, which was often not adaptable enough. This came at a compromise: the shielding of the ship suffered to allow enough power to run the arsenal. Despite that, the Destroyer quickly became Coalition's nightmare. As they say, a good offense is the best defence.
			</text>
			<choice>
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_STATUS"/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</mod-append:choice>
</mod:findName>

<mod:findName name="STORAGE_CHECK_STATUS_CREW">
	<mod-append:choice hidden="true" req="ach_crew_oe_bill" lvl="1" blue="false">
		<text>Bill</text>
		<event>
			<text>PROFILE: Bill
			Title: Acidic Castaway
			Species: Acidic Growth - Age: Unknown - Gender: N/A
			
			TODO: this text
			</text>
			<choice>
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_STATUS"/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</mod-append:choice>
</mod:findName>


<mod:findName name="STORAGE_CHECK_CREW_REAL">
	<mod-append:choice req="unique_oe_bill" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Look for Bill.</text>
		<event load="SOCIALIZE_OE_BILL_LIST"/>
	</mod-append:choice>
</mod:findName>

<mod:findName type="event" name="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB">
	<mod-append:choice req="LIST_CREW_OE_ACID" blue="false" hidden="true">
	  <text>Acidic Growth.</text>
	  <event load="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID" />
	</mod-append:choice>
</mod:findName>


<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID">
	<text>You are viewing the lab menu for: [ACIDIC GROWTH]</text>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_REPAIR" lvl="1" max_group="0" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Currently Installed: Fracture Repair Procedures.
		[Acidic Crew heal 6.4hp/s if unharmed for 5 seconds]</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_SENSOR" lvl="1" max_group="0" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Currently Installed: Polarized Sensors.
		[Acidic Crew become immune to stun]</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_COOLING" lvl="1" max_group="0" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Currently Installed: Obscuring Gas.
		[All non-Acidic crew in Acidic Gas do 0.5x Combat Damage]</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" max_group="0" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Currently Installed: None</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED" lvl="1" max_group="1" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Pri: Fracture Repair Procedures. [An upgrade is already installed]</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED" lvl="0" max_group="1" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Pri: Fracture Repair Procedures. [Cost: 5|]</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID_REPAIR" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED" lvl="1" max_group="2" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Pri: Polarized Sensors. [An upgrade is already installed]</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED" lvl="0" max_group="2" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Pri: Polarized Sensors. [Cost: 5{]</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID_SENSOR" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED" lvl="1" max_group="3" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Pri: Obscuring Gas. [An upgrade is already installed]</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED" lvl="0" max_group="3" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Pri: Obscuring Gas. [Cost: 40~ 3{]</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID_COOLING" />
	</choice>
	<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" max_group="999" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Go back.</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_LOAD" />
	</choice>
</event>


<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID_REPAIR">
	<text>You are about to install the Fracture Repair Procedures modification.
	[Effects: Acidic Crew heal 6.4hp/s if unharmed for 5 seconds]
	
	[Warning: After installing this, you will not be able to install any more primary upgrades for Acidic crew. You will not be able to deactivate this mod either.]</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Install the modification. [Cost: 5|]</text>
		<event>
			<text>You install the modification.</text>
			<item_modify>
				<item type="drones" min="-5" max="-5" />
			</item_modify>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event load="INSTALL_LAB_OE_ACID_REPAIR" />
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" max_group="1" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_LOAD" />
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="INSTALL_LAB_OE_ACID_REPAIR">
	<variable name="loc_lab_upgrades" op="add" val="1" />
	<hiddenAug>LAB_OE_ACID_REPAIR</hiddenAug>
	<hiddenAug>LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED</hiddenAug>
	<loadEvent>STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID</loadEvent>
</event>
<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID_SENSOR">
	<text>You are about to install the Polarized Sensors modification.
	[Effects: Acidic Crew become immune to stun]
	
	[Warning: After installing this, you will not be able to install any more primary upgrades for Acidic crew. You will not be able to deactivate this mod either.]</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Install the modification. [Cost: 5{]</text>
		<event>
			<text>You install the modification.</text>
			<item_modify>
				<item type="fuel" min="-5" max="-5" />
			</item_modify>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event load="INSTALL_LAB_OE_ACID_SENSOR" />
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" max_group="1" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_LOAD" />
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="INSTALL_LAB_OE_ACID_SENSOR">
	<variable name="loc_lab_upgrades" op="add" val="1" />
	<hiddenAug>LAB_OE_ACID_SENSOR</hiddenAug>
	<hiddenAug>LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED</hiddenAug>
	<loadEvent>STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID</loadEvent>
</event>

<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID_COOLING">
	<text>You are about to install the Obscuring Gas modification.
	[Effects: All non-Acidic crew in Acidic Gas do 0.5x Combat Damage]
	
	[Warning: After installing this, you will not be able to install any more primary upgrades for Acidic crew. You will not be able to deactivate this mod either.]</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Install the modification. [Cost: 40~ 3{]</text>
		<event>
			<text>You install the modification.</text>
			<item_modify>
				<item type="scrap" min="-40" max="-40" />
				<item type="fuel" min="-3" max="-3" />
			</item_modify>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event load="INSTALL_LAB_OE_ACID_COOLING" />
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" max_group="1" blue="false" hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_LOAD" />
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="INSTALL_LAB_OE_ACID_COOLING">
	<variable name="loc_lab_upgrades" op="add" val="1" />
	<hiddenAug>LAB_OE_ACID_COOLING</hiddenAug>
	<hiddenAug>LAB_OE_ACID_INSTALLED</hiddenAug>
	<loadEvent>STORAGE_CHECK_LAB_OE_ACID</loadEvent>
</event>
</FTL>